KG42.register("clusters-470c4728f81b0c98a1317fff",{"id":"47-electricity_hydrogen_market::v142-d-K001","paper":"47-electricity_hydrogen_market","label":"Voluntary participation, external trading options, and product scope","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Voluntary participation, external trading options, and product scope","market_meaning":"Players choose to trade in the LEM or the corresponding external market according to their own roles; the included price conditions for Load and DG constrain their previous-round participation, and HSSA's permission to buy and sell electricity and to sell hydrogen defines its trading direction. The electricity and hydrogen product declarations provide the scope of application.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","activation","bidding"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"Retain separately the conditions and energy-carrier scopes of Load, DG, HV, and HSSA; the strict price conditions for Load and DG apply only to the stated previous-round participation and are not generalized as sufficient participation conditions for all players. The activation label of R006 and the bidding label of R010 are retained only for original-chain traceability; HSS equipment and the HSSA agent are not merged as subject identities.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Together they express market trading choices and permission boundaries, with external price conditions, player choices, and permitted trading directions. R006 is an overlapping statement of existing participation permission and is not counted separately as a performance rule; R010 provides product background and is not counted separately as an independent bidding rule.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the buyer's trading choice and the necessary price condition for Load's previous-round participation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the energy supplier's participation mode, the DG previous-round price condition, and HSSA's bidirectional electricity participation permission."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"alternative","rationale":"Retains the same source's permission statement regarding HSSA's trading direction, and does not interpret it as an additional transaction-performance procedure."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"primary","role":"context","rationale":"Limits the stated participation permission to electricity and hydrogen, and does not infer joint clearing from the coexistence of products."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C005"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E13","v141-b-g01-E14","v141-b-g01-E17"],"rationale":"The buyer and the supplier each choose participation relative to the applicable DisCo external price; the two necessary conditions are retained in parallel by role and are not combined into a condition that all players must jointly satisfy."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g03-e001"],"rationale":"The statements on trading-direction permission and participation through bidding are complementary and overlap on HSSA's permission to sell electricity and hydrogen; the two Rule-Chains have different complete constraint scopes, are not declared to have the same expression, and no execution obligation is added."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E17"],"rationale":"The product declarations correspond to the role scopes of Load buying electricity and HV buying hydrogen; the two demands are not treated as the same commodity or the same participation criterion."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E17"],"rationale":"The product scope of electricity and hydrogen indicates the two energy carriers involved in the HSSA sales permission, and does not infer that the two are produced or traded simultaneously."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-O01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R008::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E13","v141-b-g01-E14"],"rationale":"The two Rule-Chains reference the same frozen pricing node; the representative selection is only for display and is not equivalent to the different external prices under the node."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-O02","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::v141-c-R007-theta-lambda-L-prev","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_lambda_L_prev"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E13","v141-b-g01-E14"],"rationale":"Under the same mechanism, time slot, and previous-round index, both refer to the previous-round LEM electricity price, but they respectively serve as input roles for the buyer and DG participation conditions, and the original parameter objects are retained."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G01","category":"unverified_source","description":"All B evidence referenced by this Rule-Cluster remains unverified; the experiment permits candidate assembly, which does not mean that transcription, participation conditions, or role interpretations have been independently reviewed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R008","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E13","v141-b-g01-E14","v141-b-g01-E17","v141-b-g03-e001"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the participation conditions, trading directions, and HSS/HSSA designations; retain candidate status until independent source review is completed."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G02","category":"upstream_missing","description":"R006 currently has only the unary fact of trading permission, and the unused mathematical content of C2 remains unresolved; there is no closure of quantity, timing, or responsibility from transaction outcomes to actual execution. The assembled status of this Rule-Cluster means only that the participation-permission scope is complete.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R008"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If rules for actual transaction execution are to be formed, C should explicitly revise them and provide source mappings for transaction volumes and execution activities; this round retains the original facts and does not fabricate mathematical or execution edges."}]},"rule_refs":["47-electricity_hydrogen_market::v141-c-R007","47-electricity_hydrogen_market::v141-c-R008","47-electricity_hydrogen_market::v141-c-R006","47-electricity_hydrogen_market::v141-c-R010"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-272a6ce8ab154b93","COMP-6786c966fc7c0aa0","COMP-853f64cb73659614","COMP-aacf36f95ebdd7c8","COMP-b1b0c5e3c8ca187b","COMP-c19b72437a1d5a78","COMP-c8696bb2d6d47f04","COMP-e7c615345112f85e"]});
